# Shell scripts need real LF line endings on every platform -- a CRLF-
# corrupted shebang line (`#!/usr/bin/env bash\r`) fails with "bad
# interpreter" on Linux/Mac, confirmed as a real risk here since this
# repo has no prior .gitattributes and Windows checkouts otherwise get
# CRLF by default (roadmap step 265, scripts/backup.sh + restore-drill.sh).
*.sh text eol=lf
